"""bottleopener_solidworks: SolidWorks feature tree generated by stl2cad (exact mode, 2.5D).

Builds the part in SolidWorks through its API: 1 Extruded Boss and 3 Extruded Cut feature(s) along +y,
each from a sketch on the Front Plane, built with y along z and turned back by a Move/Copy Body feature. Units: mm.
After every feature the part volume and centre of mass are checked against stl2cad's values.

Needs: Windows, SolidWorks, Python with pywin32 (pip install pywin32).
Run:   python bottleopener_solidworks.py [C:\\path\\part.SLDPRT]
"""

